Z||000000||Alex4mula||11-28-2001||01:28 PM||||I want to paint my car yellow but I'm having difficulty selecting the yellow that I like. The stock 88 yellow is too light for my taste. Viper or Corvette yellow looks nice but is too bright. I have seen an in-between in some Focus/Mustangs (yikes! yeah Ford!) but not sure if they change from year to year. The one they have for the 2002 Focus (web page) is called Egg Yolk yellow and is too bright. But I have seen others (maybe a 2000) that are not that bright. Is it common to change tones from year to year? What other yellows are you using? Which code? TIA<P>------------------<BR>    Alex4mula<BR>:) Red-Original Owner & White-1/94 with PM (:||||reg||5
